## Workflow Steps

[?2004hp1$ python -c "from pathlib import Path; print(Path('/harbor/skills/eee6c8e5-f0a9-5b74-a324-dc4c873012b5/SKILL.md').read_text()[815:942],end='')"
[?2004l- 交付前检查输入数据是否存在缺失或格式疑点
